FastAPI kya hai?
FastAPI ek Python web framework hai — jisse hum API bana sakte hain.

Simple words mein:

Tumhara React frontend kuch maangta hai (jaise AI response)
FastAPI us request ko sunта hai aur jawab deta hai

Ek simple example dekho:

from fastapi import FastAPI

app = FastAPI()

# GET request — browser se directly open kar sakte ho
@app.get("/")
def home():
    return {"message": "Hello! Backend chal raha hai!"}

# POST request — React frontend yahan message bhejega
@app.post("/chat")
def chat(user_message: str):
    return {"response": f"Tumne likha: {user_message}"}


FastAPI ke 3 main concepts:
Concept	Matlab
@app.get("/")	: Browser se GET request aane par yeh function chale
@app.post("/chat")	: Frontend se POST request aane par yeh function chale
return {}	: JSON format mein response wapas bhejo